(ii)
a transfer of property in goods (whether as goods or in some other form) involved in the execution of a works contract;
(iii)
any delivery of goods on hire-purchase or other system of payment by installments;
(iv)
a transfer of the right to use goods for any purpose (whether or not for a specified period) for cash, deferred payment or
other valuable consideration;
(v)
a supply of goods by an unincorporated association or body of persons to a member thereof for cash, deferred payment
or other valuable consideration;

